{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1292,
  "batch_count": 1652,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "33cae8524551c593c4a9016580345724140f0481",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:04c8962bbc8135351966099e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我喜欢迎面冲向\r\n开始有点变冷的秋风，\r\n虽然会冷，但感觉很舒服！",
      "source_fingerprint": "aa3d207c64e3ff0325c22d72c1360c91e4a94a24d9fe7b1ca478e474aef23c5c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "91014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c085e8ef6181bb372c230e4a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "靠跑步温暖身体吧！\r\n最近空气很干燥，\r\n要记得洗手漱口喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8a6ca71a2775ef3a0e3ed58c0d5ce208eac50e6f7b0c74e3e2f4f94d658c4c85",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "91015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ed2b3247ebe68ae2e7545cc8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你不觉得赖恩也很适合这套衣服吗？\r\n然后她再用那精神满满的声音\r\n爽朗地打招呼……一定很可爱♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "17d09cae7a9f0df0b145ffe8b2dbda919602f26974ff34ca00aef5826bf46083",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "91016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a68aef234150c3e491390c3e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我叫小微的时候不小心叫成\r\n我妹妹的名字了……耶嘿嘿，反正\r\n她就像妹妹一样可爱，没关系啦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1a2498b0be702f9c7b8a4ab237064f5955e4b02779220d338b4a1aaa11a0d6dc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "91017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:11d78b9ea292ea74b440fa91",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "请小美点餐时，不管点什么\r\n她都会用「美丽」来正面响应！\r\n听了连我都觉得很舒畅呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e1da08f80b415e3bb3d4e6460822be86ca5bdd7abdbc02cd1f477c7aa3ccd609",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "91018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6f82ce881e9ad4cb715b64ba",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊～啊……嗯？这个啊，我在练习\r\n发声！毕竟打工时须要常常说话嘛。\r\n好～今天也要加油……欢迎光临～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8ad948edf948c8a40d0081dd8305d292e1e9961e6bf287c6b296189712b7cfac",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "91019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f24fd5e3af1670733d9e4e17",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "听说我打工的拉面店也想设计一套\r\n不输给这服装的制服喔。听他们在\r\n讨论头套设计……有种不好的预感。",
      "source_fingerprint": "441cbffebee9aedaeab50670b24c0bde0452f7c836c93d4c31be43f468c9cd9f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "91020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:88321c2ddf5a6bac04893d9d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真是的～你一脸困意喔～\r\n试着大声打招呼提振精神吧。\r\n来～跟我一起喊……欢迎光临～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "63a1628a0b8c8ed819d5506002e39765b2f2d9e41829fe81c9d0aa1992eb3cac",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "91021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:257f24eb44b4c33f5ae46108",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "每次我想在外面吃午餐时，\r\n就会忍不住想多体贴店员……\r\n毕竟午餐时段很辛苦呢～",
      "source_fingerprint": "cd16ce8dccdcb28f2597b4cf0c57999724633a11e74f09f1a3134ff32252315f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "91022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:18538c951b6ca2ac0c94ec11",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "天已经黑啰。哦，看你这么惊讶～\r\n我懂我懂，忙起来的时候\r\n时间真的过得很快呢～",
      "source_fingerprint": "5372a97128724a48de3656dbda8bcc0e3a951b6930b8f59ac3ace2f116194872",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "91023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f2da28bd1a53c35a3ee9ed59",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这时期都会有很多新客人喔～\r\n看到那些青涩的表情，\r\n让我也不禁想为大家加油！",
      "source_fingerprint": "983e7e9e82da94c0a8be8cacab6dfb3d3de83ec5beef6479cde9a06a8fa271b4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "91024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e1cbfd3095f87e4020534b01",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你觉得在海之家开快闪咖啡厅如何？\r\n夏天嘛，来卖海盐香草圣代\r\n好像不错！还可以补充矿物质！",
      "source_fingerprint": "80cf29eb05c212fe3c0cf51232a0c4da4b43f025631ea42f3c4801c8970901b2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "91025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a38c454f1ef66107bd4bf5bd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "石烤番薯？我推荐直火烧烤会更香。\r\n我可是曾经卖过烤番薯，\r\n你就听听当参考吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dca1b5fc37118c6570d5b1b21b4e92616fa6305064ec4844b3bfd412f3353a84",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "91026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f613043be70fe237923060a9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我泡杯热可可给你吧？\r\n是妈妈教我怎么泡的！\r\n喝了身体会立刻暖起来，很推荐喔♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "d1ae8588cd2efcd01f930194c699847d62aa49816d368fc7c78d920c2294eb22",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "91027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a520b7e03896b376b5842747",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我曾做过不少打工，\r\n这是我穿过最可爱的一套制服了！\r\n又有很多口袋，实用性很高呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "393381fe5f215aae44aa146fc035971ee5e9d515403019e7d01e06b498fe66b6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "91028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3a310b780c4c6fe01265f39b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "头上只要没戴遮阳帽，\r\n总觉得有点心神不宁……\r\n别、别一直盯着我喔。",
      "source_fingerprint": "054a7f320529ae0de5a950a36cb78f90f64ea97b945156aa5d05dbfe3518a195",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "91029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e76c44fcb49bedee53e38dc6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "脚的状况，没问题！\r\n遮阳帽的位置，没问题！\r\n活力和干劲更是完全没问题喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4367260f4f02e92934f6b34f2e0f8a1e7b731cebb9d6ae24d46bf1b4875e9054",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "92000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:45e9609a172c82f160409a3d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "やっちゃうの！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c8d332605cd8cf624923f74d50ff5829764fee7481ffe432ad49cf6d1735c214",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "920000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:19edd7561db849ac432ac1ca",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "热身运动都做好了！\r\n快点让我尽情奔跑吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ac3c8ae375c4b85def6e9ace18a405e4a1f1108e547d7a3a37dd7b011eadf700",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "92001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6290a61189346634907ab2c6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天排的是晚班……\r\n太好了！\r\n可以做很多训练！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cd3b678687fe1220c51ecf1d8082dce5ba97b7d4df11b7b9c7c20663dda99e0f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "92002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0f0b4be9c7ed18c7e6fc754a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不管是体干训练、重量训练，\r\n还是超市的限时特卖，\r\n都尽管来吧♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "1d830ba449001060cdaca9c13d0d91472f45ce8977db4400f8085dbb0fabf786",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "92003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:13f4dc8f6ec68732b83962f2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员安排的练习项目\r\n有很多机会跑步，非常开心！\r\n今后也要让我尽情奔跑喔♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "ec53dee6d405174a248777ad3bd4db06a9d91da195c24c6875508cfe40360702",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "92005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0fc153e75b16750c8827da24",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "如果是和你一起训练，\r\n我一定能跑得更快！\r\n好～要加油啰！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cc2d1a3287e24d544b4dff2b63ee69f3a6cbb5b5d522c1e3de3f2b8ff6d67abb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "92006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:362a30a84461cbde11b87b31",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "因为你给了我许多信任，\r\n所以我也相信训练员！\r\n想让你看到我最好的表现！",
      "source_fingerprint": "98ef0ecf92b87145ae62ed0e9fa5c1631151517d9b903aaf100fc3a2927671f8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "92007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dbc91df766727f8bd7a77d7a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯～阳光真耀眼～！\r\n幸好我有遮阳帽～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2152585e6680fe09fa18f3938972562485b5545b882c4d14e438d691337237b5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "92011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5076b872ad1821a343a7f2a7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天想先从哪一项开始？\r\n看是要老样子还是想点特别品项\r\n都可以，随便你点～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "42c11f0df3a395da227386ca8452fbd741671614cc5666db7a27ffc3c370b073",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "92015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9fae89d9a283051fc308319b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你可以慢慢思考要点什么喔♪\r\n我等你决定～",
      "source_fingerprint": "c02fe2d2bdd4e8e0fa59183aeaf01be5b08c9d7f58b39b0f08e22b2a73821679",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "92016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6507354b5b925c0f33829c9c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "无论打工还是训练都是\r\n活力最重要！今天也要\r\n卯足全力加油喔～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a7005ab71b1df4069acdf6baa7d47616082a61b10610fcd9be3143c452636616",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "92017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:42b343dd9724a2d417db5b68",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "想点很复杂的也没问题喔。\r\n我会好～好地写下每一个要求，\r\n完美达成指令的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c3775e16269ea3a497d7ea99ae37b792728e33a717461563ec005572bd85e17c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "92018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e25953fc667e3ac59088658b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "请来一份「老样子」♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "331fd76c9c46d82a90841465aeeab1bf57c5e09e2211c7fd029222fb50136bcf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "92020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:249bcc1a367bc66e49824500",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我想来一份最棒的训练～！\r\n耶嘿嘿，\r\n今天换训练员当店员！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ce2a3cb21899dc95770ec9b36942616ef0e1040267b90c0849e627c464dfb75f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "92021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2aacad4a785b5c57ae656fb9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我努力工作时客人都会为我加油！\r\n所以为了在竞赛时也能得到声援，\r\n我会努力表现的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5d9b0624795323f859af78c306fa59a1479d8daf97e2089240dd0aae8a7c05f5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "92022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a3bac61f4c86e8332a837c2a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这是至今为止最开心的一次……！\r\n全都要感谢你！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6658d83b562aec613d2d7beb5996cdc843d1374d02297da084a23f7d329fa54c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "93000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a68a0ca7d25789fd3248cd95",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我是最强的姐姐，\r\n也是你最棒的赛马娘……开玩笑的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cdd90d14f0a2efd301df5a2881f5369f0c7dad52ed31e844e2fff6f9bb93f68d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "93001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:00880b96b345f34d4ebf1099",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "能将心意传达出去真是太好了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "52140b0dfc9311c8c274d762f03fd401475d27bdc7c8c8667312ec9412c208e7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "93004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3e7711d3aadd81c7f0ad5278",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我的表现应该符合你的要求吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "17f1dae642c4c89fb195677a76116e3516bc12629333a74ffab80d85143aa930",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "93005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:770709c4259f9bf24c65a916",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我要变得更快！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0ceff9ad4f20e913da5fb439ba57e5f855b999612438ede08dea60885e19328e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "95000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:83360fbe1d7f816985c31325",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我还不会就此止步！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d361e57fa812e355518ac2e5f312b7f4a790458610977159c6baa3486786756b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "95001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f9533cc49ef110cf4c362d95",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哈啰哈啰！我是艾尼斯风神！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5efc926776722cf759345f5a1da35f843140191a1338f6408146c6d1f4a3f3c7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "95003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4036e6f3b0d63e2f2d434da0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大家，看着吧。\r\n姐姐会加油的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2f43d2e7d2c5b7d9588fbcf9242ae75d3898f30a7798729c5752b454018e5811",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "95004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4fc2f6e58c9b0e8c587679d5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "支援就交给我吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fb361514687f96b7e8ce19c0c8fa4564242ad0839f18d4f68d81df9c59820d03",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "95005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dee0ef3cb68020a93177d73d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我会更努力、更努力支援的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3645c00004ba70d6bc3adda1b3412e1c09171aaec36690237cf7b029cde4baf8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "95006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b61f90fbfe9b499ba7a5344e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我会更加努力达成你点的期望的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "045dd7c166dbd9432c5c68749c5b225827682bc8fb8209da12a4080d84a26fe0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "95007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:66ac3c65ab37f2a22f8f20f4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "已确认到追加内容了♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "620f10839b28d4da9ae64dc4f543b6f6b59464f6b44965b01d47c5a0a6b4cc8a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "95008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:de74a11db2f4a9df756347b6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "收到～！\r\n你想来一份我的胜利是吧♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "1e9bc099e1f5bde112ce7127d29646a1f55a5e9c4c3967417242b80919a2334b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "95009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aa252df29bfbff0db6cee608",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我是艾尼斯风神！\r\n请问要点餐了吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "aa4a004f323ecf6add8ce493e55dd7bce323df87ac2e8b05c4af84586e3e9c07",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1031",
        "95010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:95597bdbb57f5ae105db5f73",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "来，开始实验吧…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "98b360a0e3a6f6c0e5aabdddf66c7466879a88af205fa01d69681d5f5cfc296a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "1000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6ba2b1b16c47a11ff1bed852",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你向我发出入队邀请时的眼神，\r\n真令人难忘呢。现在如何呢？\r\n…与那时相比，那种想法有没有加深呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "c79d22731895375a23cbe9343d787c7d073bf398de5a8ee789a0d49ea4d55e4c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "10000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:38f21ff87feeab993068dd2b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "じゃ、行ってくるよ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "528413d818319da20a5c35a197170a059c8f14cea272e9a16ff79d5e96465dfc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "100000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7010575d4fa5f3501c3cd25b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ただいま～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "54290808a3e3c1b396c2e16f2fb30f6867b432b72e872ca49eb13fcaa3e944b0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "100001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aa1a89a208275a0e411b476d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你是我的豚鼠，\r\n同时也是我的助手。\r\n要给我好好工作哦？",
      "source_fingerprint": "095c087dada622362729f714e3602553f9bbb7132f7fc4184ae8a7bcc1ecb30e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "10001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:80ee9353ca5ab6c420385e79",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员君，给我揉肩、\r\n扫地、再泡一杯红茶呗\r\n为我效劳不是你的职责吗。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f840b9812364bed7f1b734d14d16d7d208fd49ddd4bd9e3a7c46471319cac560",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "10002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b8644f43469a8b04f67fcc18",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "新年快乐。今年\r\n也要注意身体健康，\r\n好好做个豚鼠哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9147c27593531923266f1648ed5ff6577421104cd02e481368b7ae8b16b0297d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "10003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:004aa62f125fe81bdbcb336f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我的大脑与糖分可是\r\n密不可分的…你，应该\r\n为我准备巧克力了吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "9641c3e4f16c200e206b687e2fd6538bec2c170a22b3111a2a23aee8e87b0db2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "10004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:16264365ce6dca6d27a7a5df",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我给你做了巧克力哦，里面加入了我的爱情\r\n和其他各种东西！不要客气，\r\n赶紧吃掉然后给我写一份报告吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "12573b798e8909293537a10a803fa5e875cea1b177a92589025a12cb8d3449ca",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "10005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:13f8eeda1dc5aa999a1706f7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "牛郎和织女要跨过银河相会的话…\r\n那他们究竟以何种速度\r\n移动呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "944be3e01180a0da49f06146224ea3b24f83ecdfdefab2f050ab3f68c642f274",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "10006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:891fb6d1018dbebc47af294d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "选实验还是选点心，\r\n没有这种必要哦。\r\n毕竟你本来就没有选择权这类东西嘛！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b8a275377f6917a943f5c6030d4a39c880d5c18c3872e1c762c91624e92b564b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "10007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a2d2d63d5e7118d087ef5cb6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一个晚上就能环游世界的驯鹿…\r\n能承受住这种速度的雪橇和圣诞老人的强韧度\r\n…这种东西存在的话可是个大威胁啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "00134b9cb39999a96d05bcfa90c8e9ae45c860eedc619bc17ee785ee685d42e3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "10008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:08843dbaa5a7433999680553",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我买了补充糖分用的蛋糕。\r\n…怎么了？赶紧去准备\r\n两个盘子啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cc257cc0fc1cb998e09bd9fec429cf71fcf173a2ffa2b823a3fe1cf04581be3c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "10009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a8c20db155de245e253c7e8a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "理所当然。",
      "source_fingerprint": "df8b1840a79f3894990111e73d2d38f4159afd7fdf22ef3a4cdb634385e8fd7d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "1001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:58858b9bb5bec45e8c4376c0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "到年末了啊…自从得到你这只豚鼠之后，\r\n感觉时间的流速变得\r\n相当快了呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "70be92fbcdcf11d4975dad28439230efbdf5f58b03aa3a5b834cdf48e0bcaaee",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "10010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ade24cb7a7f4612817e01419",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "生日？哎呀哎呀，恭喜！\r\n恭喜啊！为庆祝你的生日\r\n来做个肉体改造实验怎么样？",
      "source_fingerprint": "681036a5b8cb2d66ed3ce9a80747fe61aec470857de1c7d9d5e6d2a69230e5b9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "10011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:31ad0d46f83590a9f3a90d4d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你能诞生真是太好了啊。\r\n…豚鼠兼助手这种东西，\r\n可不是轻易就能得到的呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "43ae04b04ff8e41377b3f8a506f5d82425d8211241e089ee7acb4cac390931dc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "10012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e1b75029fd56a3d623d713f4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我的生日？…啊啊，我都忘了。\r\n帮大忙了，毕竟肉体年龄也会对实验\r\n产生影响。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9ad709185650d040ea8e3e0322d786c08f8a45aa3676f22cc5a0a108a7acb076",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "10013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3f084cdff8fa44cc47994bd9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "给我庆祝生日，感觉你也\r\n得不到什么东西…\r\n但奇怪的是我也没感到哪里不好。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dba309f12a22d74bd6d05066eccec3611b94dfa79d7c8c16f3415991448bd5b6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "10014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a31d8665b860bf64b99bf09f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哦呀，收到新消息了。\r\n你去帮我确认一下。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2467d5e8b2644887669e7e046b79c2ac5a5e430e6b6f48262cfa294100a5108d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "10015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1e15ff8eda2b03de52282bfe",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "收到礼物了哦。\r\n对实验有没有用呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "90b8ce519bba08e9235d05c4425b8dd22c042001fd91d257e185902146f55faa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "10016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a578b09e3e231bb144c3493a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嚯，完成任务了呢！\r\n然后，结果呢？\r\n肉体有没有什么变化？",
      "source_fingerprint": "dc76ffe2bc92af7b1fef0ef616806ad40ada00b58a938df9069e6acb7d05a887",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "10017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7ac1720aef05a7314735bc7a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "活动正在准备中吗…\r\n或许有利于采集数据呢。\r\n去确认一下吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "19b30d1559bcd6334742cef912be1ac2007b2819c89d13294cc7e1213082a9af",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "10018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:866464007ac75fe7b4a3331e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好像正在举办活动哦。\r\n为了能收集到信息，\r\n得积极地参加呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "93fc4b2bb7162092b7b7d13c91b6721a081f97e9872e69835feb53c5fe284154",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "10019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9c42ef3a930ae96f91f36cae",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有必要重新审视一下了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "188e05ffb22f73b820a12a8695f878ce75958d17487d0806d06f4fd03e8d3c6f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "1002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b8bf83b322f46357b3989c52",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "赛马娘名鉴等级提高了呢\r\n是研究带来的成果吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "4af933eb3254d7b9de66833ba3602e24261a0be424df8ddbe4963715246620eb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "10021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2f30b174d47abb7b7df98d51",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "便服这样就够了。\r\n因为订新的不是很麻烦吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "f2c3aee4b1ac3516c1aa67c7b275f79d9df7b90f6fc93220da663ceea4cb7775",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "10025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b463fa6169bf3e8e3fd4e72d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不时会有人提醒我衣服\r\n前后穿反了。我觉得就外观\r\n和机能性而言，都没什么问题啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1d8980b4be30afa12bd554b8272105a8845f3692379909c0f8405cc6c7d9ed7d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "10026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:24c34da7ba3c0402ce93fa97",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "领口的脱线……\r\n是一开始就这样吗？\r\n不，可能是因为被药品融掉了吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9cfa650d1c65bc60bd314c4e009ab3884734de8b78934d0e2381845867facae7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "10027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:814e90cb45813d537b21d8a7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有所收获呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6367b8c6a6fa219a24c7105fe497b652f20fd8e362ed468c5d52686cd704c3e5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "1003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:615514cf7850f434e7e079fc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "可能性还在增大呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "37c5c83387374e142471dd9c86748d02d852a8dad60f25cd533c9168b21d2fea",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "1004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a6fe3a938b141253eee6c0c7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有必要重新审视一下了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "188e05ffb22f73b820a12a8695f878ce75958d17487d0806d06f4fd03e8d3c6f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "1005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4455b584f80a607f390b9f88",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有所收获呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6367b8c6a6fa219a24c7105fe497b652f20fd8e362ed468c5d52686cd704c3e5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "1006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bf01e2533f92d6be9b7cc61b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "新纪录…这就叫成果啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "450761cbb5846d10df4060b2333389e52cce0ad5743a771650710605da21496e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "1007"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
